    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Paris-based commerce technology studio (legal entity Unlikely Studio, founded 2017; president Maxime Berthelot, DG Simon Corompt). Specialises in unified / e-commerce: design, build and run commerce platforms, migrations and integrations across Shopify, Salesforce, BigCommerce, Prestashop plus ERP/POS. 50+ clients over the years, mostly French luxury/lifestyle brands: Nina Ricci, Jean Paul Gaultier, Jimmy Fairly, Yse, Eric Bompard, Lunii, Gerard Darel. Specialised hands-on commerce engineering team, so classified Studio (rather than broad full-service Agency), high autonomy as an independent shop. Frontend (web) tag fits; they also do backend/platform integration. Size 2-10 is the migration figure and uncertain (no public headcount; a 50+ client commerce shop may be larger, possibly 11-40). Jonathan note: considered them for tractable.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-06-15T21:38:57",
      "set_by": "agent"
    },
